-2"></i>Tandai sudah logout</button></form>@endif<form method="POST" action="{{ route('admin.transactions.inactive', $transaction) }}" onsubmit="return confirm('Tandai transaksi ini tidak aktif?')">@csrf @method('PATCH')<button class="btn btn-outline-danger w-100"><i class="fa-solid fa-ban me-2"></i>Tandai tidak aktif</button></form><a href="{{ route('admin.transactions.receipt', $transaction) }}" target="_blank" class="btn btn-light w-100 mt-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-print me-2"></i>Cetak struk</a></div></section></div></div>
